figdown 0.2 statechart
# `statechart` declares NO subject vocabulary (`SCENE-KEYWORD-MEMBERSHIP`). `external` is the sharp
# cell: UML 2.5.1 §14 already spells a TransitionKind `external`, so the word
# is reserved here rather than merely absent (`RESERVED-SPELLINGS`).
state a "A"
state b "B"
transition a -> b
external e "Upstream"
group g "Region"
